# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization.
#
# `eol=lf` is the part that matters on Windows. Without it, `core.autocrlf=true`
# hands the working tree CRLF while Biome's formatter insists on LF, so a fresh
# clone fails `pnpm lint` on every file it has not yet rewritten — and a stray
# `git checkout` of one file is enough to reintroduce it mid-branch.
* text=auto eol=lf
